Third-party software
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

PDF.js, version 6.4.299
Copyright 2024 Mozilla Foundation
https://github.com/mozilla/pdf.js

Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The two files that ship with
this build are `vendor/pdf.min.mjs` and `vendor/pdf.worker.min.mjs`, copied
unmodified from the published package `pdfjs-dist`. build.py inlines both of
them into index.html as text, and the page turns that text into blob URLs when
a PDF is opened, so the renderer runs from the same file as the rest of the
application. The full licence text is in `vendor/LICENSE-pdfjs.txt`.

No other library is bundled. No analytics, no fonts, no CDN request: the page
asks nothing of the network at runtime, not even the copy of the renderer it
needs, because that copy is inside the page.

